+No configured or environment source is not an error. HTTPS has an anonymous
+transport, so an uncovered repository is fetched anonymously. There is no
+install-time credential discovery or interactive candidate prompt for HTTPS:
+the operator explicitly chooses a source with `add` or provides a token through
+`login`. `list` is the presence-only check for those configured candidates; it
+does not reveal tokens or select a credential for a repository.
